iting Competition. He has also earned recognition for projects involving space research, artificial intelligence and robotics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-aryash-shyam-the-14-year-old-indian-american-student-who-won-a-1000-national-writing-prize-for-a-historical-fiction-story-set-in-a-philadelphia-print-shop-on-july-4-1776/articleshow/134916156.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-aryash-shyam-the-14-year-old-indian-american-student-who-won-a-1000-national-writing-prize-for-a-historical-fiction-story-set-in-a-philadelphia-print-shop-on-july-4-1776/articleshow/134916156.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:50:00 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>TOI WORLD DESK</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="39062" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134916427,imgsize-39062.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Australian homeowner wins A$6,253.50 after neighbour’s bamboo blocked sewer]]></title><description><![CDATA[In a landmark decision, an Australian court addressed a bamboo dispute affecting two neighboring properties in New South Wales. The court determined that the bamboo created a blockage and posed a risk for future damage to the sewer line. As a result, Homes NSW was ordered to compensate A$6,253.50 for previous treatment costs. The ruling highlights the importance of communication and diligent records for homeowners facing similar issues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-homeowner-said-bamboo-from-next-door-spread-beneath-his-fence-and-blocked-his-sewer-court-finds-a-future-damage-risk-orders-staged-removal-and-a6253-50-toward-treatment-and-repairs/articleshow/134921533.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/australian-homeowner-said-bamboo-from-next-door-spread-beneath-his-fence-and-blocked-his-sewer-court-finds-a-future-damage-risk-orders-staged-removal-and-a6253-50-toward-treatment-and-repairs/articleshow/134921533.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:55:00 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>TOI WORLD DESK</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="55758" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921566,imgsize-55758.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US ends 540-day grace period for immigrants after work authorisation expires]]></title><description><![CDATA[In a significant policy shift, the US Department of Homeland Security has abolished the 540-day automatic extension for work permits. This development results in immediate loss of work authorization for many, particularly affecting H-4 visa holders and asylum seekers, even while their renewal applications are pending. Moreover, the USCIS continues to face notable delays in processing these renewals, leading to a legal challenge from impacted parties contesting the new regulation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/us-department-of-homeland-security-removes-540-day-grace-period-for-immigrants-after-their-work-authorisation-expires-heres-what-the-new-rules-say/articleshow/134932607.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/us-department-of-homeland-security-removes-540-day-grace-period-for-immigrants-after-their-work-authorisation-expires-heres-what-the-new-rules-say/articleshow/134932607.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:31:43 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>TOI TECH DESK</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="59562" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134932652,imgsize-59562.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Viral TikTok turned jewellery hobby into business targeting $2.5m annual sales]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-viral-tiktok-helped-danielle-meyer-turn-her-colourful-jewellery-hobby-into-a-business-targeting-2-5-million-in-annual-sales/articleshow/134941637.c