gratitude for the verdict, hoping it deters future crimes. Both convicts were sentenced after their trial concluded on Wednesday.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/meerut/punishing-guilty-is-also-dharma-meerut-court-invokes-mahabharata-in-blue-drum-murder-case/articleshow/134943219.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/meerut/punishing-guilty-is-also-dharma-meerut-court-invokes-mahabharata-in-blue-drum-murder-case/articleshow/134943219.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:30:05 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>SANDEEP RAI</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="100416" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134943473,imgsize-100416.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul &amp; Priyanka meet Ankita Bhandari's parents at India Gate; all about 2022 murder case]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-meets-ankita-bhandaris-family-at-india-gate/articleshow/134945131.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-meets-ankita-bhandaris-family-at-india-gate/articleshow/134945131.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:04:57 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>YASHASVI VASISTHA</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="791437" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134945414,imgsize-791437.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Shai Hope scripts history, surpasses Chris Gayle in major T20I milestone for West Indies]]></title><description><![CDATA[In an explosive performance, Shai Hope delivered an unbeaten 102 from just 50 balls during the fourth T20I against India, becoming the first player from the West Indies to notch three T20I centuries. His outstanding innings propelled West Indies to an impressive 247/3 after 20 overs, with vital contributions from Shimron Hetmyer and Sherfane Rutherford, leaving Indian bowlers struggling to keep up with the relentless West Indies pace.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-west-indies/shai-hope-scripts-history-surpasses-chris-gayle-in-major-t20i-milestone-for-west-indies/articleshow/134945998.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/india-vs-west-indies/shai-hope-scripts-history-surpasses-chris-gayle-in-major-t20i-milestone-for-west-indies/articleshow/134945998.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:30:52 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>NITESH DUBEY</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="93414" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134946363,imgsize-93414.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Child among 6 killed in small plane crash in Wisconsin; FAA, NTSB probe underway]]></title><description><![CDATA[Six individuals lost their lives, including a child, after a plane crash in Wisconsin Dells. The small Piper PA-46 was travelling from Kenosha to Menomonie when it went down. Weather conditions at the time are being investigated to determine their impact on the crash. Authorities received reports of the aircraft down just before 10 pm, with rescue teams finding no survivors.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-among-6-killed-in-small-plane-crash-in-wisconsin-faa-ntsb-probe-underway/articleshow/134946355.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/child-among-6-killed-in-small-plane-crash-in-wisconsin-faa-ntsb-probe-underway/articleshow/134946355.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:35:12 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>YASHASVI VASISTHA</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="36914" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134946512,imgsize-36914.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Why are you ruining nation?' Dipke heckled, called 'CIA agent' at Delhi airport]]></title><description><![CDATA[Dipke landed in Delhi a day after his party's co-convenors, Saurav Das and Ashutosh Ranka, surreptitiously climbed a gate at the prohibited area of Jantar Mantar to protest against Chief Election Commissioner (CEC)  Gyanesh Kumar and the government, which has denotified Jantar Mantar as a designated protest site. Later, Das and Ranka were sent to 5-day judicial custody on the order of Delhi's special executive magistrate court.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-are-you-ruining-nation-cjps-abhijeet-dipke-heckled-with-cia-agent-remark-at-delhi-airport/articleshow/134939956.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-are-you-ruining-nation-cjps-abhijeet-dipke-heckled-with-cia-agent-remark-at-delhi-airport/articleshow/134939956.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:39:07 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>RAJEEV SINGH</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="101671" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134940599,imgsize-101671.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What does RBI's new Consolidated Account Statement measure benefit you? Explained]]></title><description><![CDATA[RBI’s new CAS move: Announced on October 7, 2026, the measures will allow SEBI-regulated depositories to include information related to deposit accounts in CAS. RBI Governor Sanjay Malhotra said the measures would be implemented by December 31, 2026. Let’s understand what all is expected to be consolidated and what it means for you:]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/rbis-new-cas-move-explained-track-fds-in-multiple-banks-shares-mfs-in-one-place-and-why-it-matters/articleshow/134939369.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/rbis-new-cas-move-explained-track-fds-in-multiple-banks-shares-mfs-in-one-place-and-why-it-matters/articleshow/134939369.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:55:12 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>SMRITI JAIN</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="282097" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134943979,imgsize-282097.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[3 Indians killed in Germany fire, 5 injured; resident arrested on murder suspicion]]></title><description><![CDATA[The victims were two women aged 25 and 27, and a 26-year-old man, German public broadcaster WDR reported, citing Bochum police. Their identities and home states in India have not been disclosed. The five injured people suffered smoke inhalation and were taken to hospitals in Bochum. Their nationalities have not been reported.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/3-indians-killed-in-germany-fire-5-injured-resident-arrested-on-murder-suspicion/articleshow/134945590.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/3-indians-killed-in-germany-fire-5-injured-resident-arrested-on-murder-suspicion/articleshow/134945590.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:31:48 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>RAJEEV SINGH</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="191936" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134945660,imgsize-191936.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘No resolution without Tibet’: Tibetan parl calls China's Ladakh claims 'baseless']]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tibetan-parliament-calls-chinas-ladakh-claims-baseless-urges-india-to-scrap-one-china-policy/articleshow/134946043.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tibetan-parliament-calls-chinas-ladakh-claims-baseless-urges-india-to-scrap-one-china-policy/articleshow/134946043.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:05:17 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>SUBHADRA SRIVASTAVA</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="413142" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134946113,imgsize-413142.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India's WPI inflation surges to 11.39% in September on higher food, fuel prices]]></title><description><![CDATA[India's wholesale price index-based inflation surged to 11.39% in September due to higher food, manufactured items, and energy prices. Wholesale inflation has risen significantly amidst global commodity inflation linked to the ongoing West Asia conflict. The rising costs have impacted various aspects of the economy, including the manufacturing sector and consumer prices. Retail inflation also increased to 5.54%, marking its highest level in 23 months.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/indias-wpi-inflation-surges-to-record-high-of-11-39-in-september-on-higher-food-fuel-prices/articleshow/134945901.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/indias-wpi-inflation-surges-to-record-high-of-11-39-in-september-on-higher-food-fuel-prices/articleshow/134945901.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:02:00 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>YASHASVI VASISTHA</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="138342" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134946044,imgsize-138342.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[700 supermarkets hit, millions lost: France warns refrigeration cyberattacks may persist]]></title><description><![CDATA[A cyberattack targeting refrigeration systems at supermarkets in France has led to significant disruptions in food supply chains. The attack, which occurred on Monday, affected approximately 700 supermarkets, causing spoilage and financial losses. Authorities warn that the cyber threats might still be active, urging retailers to enhance their security measures. Investigations are ongoing, but no group has claimed responsibility for these incidents.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/700-supermarkets-hit-millions-lost-france-warns-cyberattacks-on-refrigeration-systems-may-still-be-ongoing/articleshow/134944953.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/700-supermarkets-hit-millions-lost-france-warns-cyberattacks-on-refrigeration-systems-may-still-be-ongoing/articleshow/134944953.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:31:33 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>YASHASVI VASISTHA</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="187186" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134944996,imgsize-187186.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Erling Haaland buys five-bedroom Abu Dhabi villa where homes average $2.9 million]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/erling-haaland-buys-a-five-bedroom-abu-dhabi-villa-where-homes-average-2-9-million-his-father-has-bought-one-in-the-same-development/articleshow/134940634.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/erling-haaland-buys-a-five-bedroom-abu-dhabi-villa-where-homes-average-2-9-million-his-father-has-bought-one-in-the-same-development/articleshow/134940634.cms]]></guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0530</pubDate><dc:creator>TOI LIFESTYLE DESK</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" length="601252" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134940769,imgsize-601252.cms"/></item></channel></rss>